To Install you require the following:

Create your folder and save the Muxy10.py into it
cd into your created folder and do the following:

python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install pyinstaller PyQt6 Pillow

You can now run: python Muxy10.py

Use Pyinstaller to compile the binary with the following command:

pyinstaller --onefile --windowed --name Muxy Muxy10.py

